<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Union Bank 9-mth profit higher.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Union Bank 9-mth profit higher.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month result for Union Bank of Nigeria Plc to end-June 1997. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				     1997	 1996</p>
<p>Gross earnings		    7,300 vs 7,900</p>
<p>Profit before taxation	  1,000 vs 754.1</p>
<p>Taxation			    151.3 vs 113.1</p>
<p>Profit after taxation	     858 vs 641</p>
<p>($1-83 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
